* 5-5 RLC: 0 → 2 V の段、R1 = 100 Ω、L1 = 10 mH、C1 = 100 nF (巻線抵抗は 0。CH2 = C1 の電圧)
V1 a 0 PULSE(0 2 0 1n 1n 5m 10m)
R1 a b 100
L1 b c 10m
C1 c 0 100n
.step param dummy list 1 2
.tran 0 2m 0 0.2u
.meas tran vmax MAX V(c)
.meas tran tpk MAX V(c) 
.meas tran v100 FIND V(c) AT=100u
.meas tran t90 WHEN V(c)=1.8 RISE=1
.meas tran vend FIND V(c) AT=900u
.end
